            <div class="feature-item-title">Google Pay</div>
            Supported via Stripe's wallet integration. One-tap payment for Android users.
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
            <div class="feature-item-title">Card Payment</div>
            Standard card entry with full SCA/3D Secure support. Card brand and last 4 digits recorded for reference.
