        <div class="feature-item">
            <div class="feature-item-title">Billing Capture</div>
            Customer name and email are captured during payment for receipt delivery and customer analytics.
        </div>
    </div>

    <h3>Transaction Data Captured</h3>
    <p>Every NFC/QR payment records comprehensive data for analytics and dispute resolution:</p>
    <ul class="clean">
        <li>QR code ID, game location, game, PulseBox assignment</li>
        <li>Payment amount and currency</li>
        <li>Card brand, last 4 digits, wallet type (Apple Pay, Google Pay, or card)</li>
        <li>Stripe payment method ID for traceability</li>
        <li>Billing name and email</li>
        <li>Game start command ID and result payload</li>
        <li>Full timestamp trail (created, modified)</li>
