    <p class="section-intro">
        SapiensCore provides a hierarchical permission system that controls access to every function in the platform. From system administrators to counter staff, each user sees only what they need and can only do what they're authorized to do.
    </p>

    <h3>Permission Hierarchy</h3>
    <table class="data-table">
        <tr>
            <th>Level</th>
            <th>Access</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>System Admin</strong></td>
            <td>Full platform access across all organizations and locations. Configuration, user management, system settings.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Organization Admin</strong></td>
            <td>Full access within their organization's locations. Cannot see other organizations' data.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Location Manager</strong></td>
            <td>Manage operations at assigned locations. View reports, manage staff, handle customer operations.</td>
        </tr>
