    <h3>Activity Packages</h3>
    <p class="section-intro">
        Activity packages define the bookable offerings at each venue. Each package specifies what's included, how it's priced, and where it's available. Packages are configured per organization and can be assigned to specific locations.
    </p>

    <h4>Package Components</h4>
    <ul class="clean">
        <li><strong>Activity type:</strong> Birthday party, jump session, bowling, general event, or custom activity</li>
        <li><strong>Duration:</strong> Time slot length in minutes</li>
        <li><strong>Capacity:</strong> Minimum and maximum participant count</li>
        <li><strong>Pricing:</strong> Base price with per-person options</li>
        <li><strong>Inclusions:</strong> What's included (game credits, food, drinks, etc.)</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Birthday Pricing</h3>
    <p>SapiensCore supports day-specific birthday party pricing, recognizing that weekend parties command different rates than weekday parties:</p>

    <div class="value-prop">
        <div class="value-prop-title">Day-Specific Rate Configuration</div>
        <p>Operators can set different prices for Monday through Sunday, enabling premium weekend pricing and promotional weekday rates. This applies per activity package, so different party tiers can have different day-based pricing structures.</p>
    </div>

    <h3>Location-Level Package Management</h3>
    <p>Activity packages are managed at the organization level but deployed at the location level through the Activity Package Location system. This enables:</p>
    <ul class="clean">
        <li>A package to be available at some locations but not others</li>
        <li>Location-specific pricing overrides for the same package</li>
        <li>Capacity adjustments based on the physical facility at each venue</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Reservation Reporting</h3>
    <p>The reservation analytics module provides activity-level reporting including booking volumes, revenue, no-show rates, and payment status distribution &mdash; filterable by location, activity type, and date range.</p>

