<div class="page page-break">
    <div class="chapter-header">
        <div class="chapter-number">Chapter 20</div>
        <h2>Anti-Fraud, Cash Control &amp; Security</h2>
        <p>In entertainment venues, theft is a daily reality. SapiensCore treats it as an engineering problem.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="section-intro">
        Entertainment venues face a unique challenge: high volumes of cash, dozens of staff members with physical access, unattended machines, and prize counters where value is constantly exchanged. Things get stolen &mdash; cash from machines, tickets from stations, balances from loyalty cards. SapiensCore provides purpose-built tools to detect, prevent, and investigate every type of loss.
    </p>

    <h3>Transaction Security</h3>
    <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="feature-item">
            <div class="feature-item-title">Chargeback Management</div>
            Dedicated chargeback tracking and dispute resolution workflow. Manage evidence submission, track dispute outcomes, and identify repeat offenders.
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
            <div class="feature-item-title">Risk Merchant Management</div>
            Monitor Stripe risk levels for merchant accounts. Track and respond to risk escalations before they impact processing.
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
            <div class="feature-item-title">IP Geolocation</div>
            Track the geographic origin of online transactions. Flag transactions from unexpected locations or known fraud hotspots.
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
            <div class="feature-item-title">Ethoca (Mastercard)</div>
            Early fraud alerts before formal chargebacks are filed. Review and respond to Ethoca alerts within the admin panel.
        </div>
    </div>

    <h3>Device Security</h3>
    <table class="data-table">
        <tr><th>Measure</th><th>Description</th></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Encrypted Token Auth</strong></td><td>PulseBox and terminal communications use encrypted token authentication</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>PIN Encryption</strong></td><td>Payment terminal PINs are encrypted end-to-end, never stored in plaintext</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Card Masking</strong></td><td>Bank card numbers are masked to last 4 digits throughout the system</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Stripe SCA/3DS</strong></td><td>Strong Customer Authentication for all online card payments, as required by PSD2</td></tr>
    </table>

    <div class="page-footer">
