    <p class="section-intro">
        The prize counter is a revenue driver and customer engagement tool. SapiensCore provides full product catalog management with ticket-based redemption, per-location availability, and inventory tracking.
    </p>

    <h3>Product Catalog</h3>
    <table class="data-table">
        <tr>
            <th>Feature</th>
            <th>Description</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
