    <h3>Ticket-to-Product Redemption</h3>
    <p>The redemption flow connects the loyalty card's ticket balance to the product catalog:</p>

    <div class="flow-diagram">
        <div class="flow-step">Customer Selects Prize</div>
        <span class="flow-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        <div class="flow-step" style="background: var(--accent-dark);">System Checks Ticket Balance</div>
        <span class="flow-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        <div class="flow-step">Deduct Tickets</div>
        <span class="flow-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        <div class="flow-step" style="background: var(--success);">Record Redemption</div>
    </div>

    <p>Each redemption creates a Reward operation on the loyalty card, recording the products redeemed, the ticket cost per product, and the resulting balance. Redemptions can also be reversed via Redeem Return operations if a product needs to be exchanged.</p>

    <h3>Product Sales Analytics</h3>
    <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="feature-item">
            <div class="feature-item-title">Sales Volume</div>
            Track which products are redeemed most frequently, helping optimize prize inventory and purchasing.
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
            <div class="feature-item-title">Ticket Consumption</div>
            Monitor total tickets consumed at the prize counter vs. tickets earned at games. Ensure sustainable ratios.
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
            <div class="feature-item-title">Location Comparison</div>
            Compare prize redemption patterns across venues to optimize product assortment per location.
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
            <div class="feature-item-title">Inventory Tracking</div>
            Warehouse management for prize inventory with stock level monitoring and reorder triggers.
        </div>
    </div>

